  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上世纪五十年代，北京天桥派出所抓了个捡废铁的老头，穿的破破烂烂，弯腰在垃圾堆里翻金属，翻了大半天。民警一看，这不是小偷，就是搞破坏的，直接给扣了。老头急得直解释，没人信，一个捡破烂的能有什么来头？直到一个小时后，钱三强亲自跑来了，进门第一句话，全场民警全傻了。你们知道他是谁吗？他是我们国家最珍贵的大脑，这个被当成小偷抓的老头叫彭环武，你可能没听过这名字。但我告诉你，中国第一颗原子弹、第一颗氢弹理论设计背后掌舵的人就是他邓稼先、周光照、俞敏这些如雷贯耳的名字全是他一手带出来的，你敢信吗？这么一位国之栋梁，当年在天桥减肥一体，被人当小偷抓。但这还不是最狠的。时间倒回一九三八年，二十三岁的彭焕武考上了国家公派留学，拿着这笔钱去英国读博了拜。在量子力学奠基人波恩门下伯恩是谁？爱因斯坦三十年的老友诺贝尔物理学奖得主。他给爱因斯坦写信，专门夸这个中国学生，彭桓武比我其他所有学生都聪明能干，好像什么都懂。薛定谔就是搞薛定谔的猫，那位大神也惊叹，不敢相信这年轻人学了那么多，理解的那么快。二十五岁哲学博士，三十岁科学博士三十三岁当选爱尔兰皇家科学院院士、欧洲顶尖机构，抢着给终身教职天价薪资顶级实验室永久居住权。全世界都觉得这中国人铁定留西方了。可一九四七年冬天，彭环武干的件，所有人都看不懂的事，变卖欧洲，全部家产一分不留，只买了一张回国的船票。有人问他，国外什么都有了，干嘛回去？彭欢武当场不高兴了，这问题不该这么问。该问的是为什么不回国？后来这句话传了，半个世纪回国，不需要理由不回国才需要理由，硬不硬气。可回国之后呢，一穷二白，要啥没啥研究所刚成立，连实验仪器都买不起。前三强发动大家去旧货市场捡零件，自己做。彭黄武已经是爱尔兰皇家科学院院士了，照样跟年轻人一起跑天桥翻垃圾，翻着翻着就被民警抓了。这就是开头那一幕，你以为这就够难了，更狠的还在后面。一九五九年苏联专家全线撤离图纸设备数据，一个字没留下。西方媒体公开嘲讽，中国二十年也造不出核武器国家。一声号令，彭黄武带着一群年轻人扎进戈壁。荒漠，没有高级计算机怎么办？靠算盘、靠计算尺，靠手写亿万组精密数据一笔一笔手算出来。讨论会上，有人不敢开口，怕说错。 Ip彭欢武拍桌子在原子弹面前没有老师，谁也不懂有想法，就说谁说的对听谁的就这么着。他带着邓稼先、周光照、黄祖恰于敏一帮人在简陋平房里，硬生生打通了核武器全部核心理论关卡，业内送他一个称号，培养物理学家的物理学家周光昭，后来说中国核物理、理论界差不多，所有后来的工作者都是彭桓武直接或间接的学生。一九六四年十月十六日，中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功，罗布泊的蘑菇云冲上云霄，举国欢腾。庆功宴上，彭桓武提笔写下不是工农兵协力，焉得数理化成功，功劳全给了集体。后来国家自然科学奖一等奖的奖章送来，他坚决不收奖章。是我的了，我把它送给九所扯过一张纸，写下十四个字，集体嗯集体集体日新。日新日日新，有人问他，一辈子隐姓埋名，默默奉献，委屈，不他淡淡一句，我是中国人，为国做事理所应当。你看，这就是彭黄武科研上的盖世天才，生活里却笨得让人心疼，不会做饭，不会洗衣一辈子，没搞懂军事旅团，谁官大同事戴不戴眼镜，他都记不住，四十三岁了，还是光棍一条。直到有一天，二姐叫她回家吃饭，一进门看见一位陌生姑娘，心里咯噔一下，又是相亲，可这一次他没抗拒，因为看清眼前这位贤静端正的姑娘时，她从心底里喜欢上了这位姑娘，叫刘炳贤。山东人护士。谁也没想到，这个生活不能自理的科学怪人，写出去的表白信，居然全在列自己的缺点。而姑娘的回信，让这个四十三岁的男人第一次感受到了家的温暖，他们的故事才刚开始。而这段感情，后来让全中国都红了眼眶。朋友们，彭桓武的故事。上集，咱们讲到这儿，下集，我给你讲，他和妻子刘炳贤那段跨越生死的感情，还有他晚年把自己一切都捐出去的很近。如果你也被这位老人打动了，先点个赞，再点收藏。评论区留一句，致敬。彭老顺手转发给身边的人，让更多人知道我们今天的和平日子。是这样一群人。拿命换来的关注我。下集接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1470,
      "text": "上世纪五十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1870,
      "end_ms": 5290,
      "text": "北京天桥派出所抓了个捡废铁的老头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5750,
      "end_ms": 6770,
      "text": "穿的破破烂烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7290,
      "end_ms": 9390,
      "text": "弯腰在垃圾堆里翻金属，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9690,
      "end_ms": 10855,
      "text": "翻了大半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13250,
      "end_ms": 14070,
      "text": "民警一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14490,
      "end_ms": 15550,
      "text": "这不是小偷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15550,
      "end_ms": 16570,
      "text": "就是搞破坏的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16690,
      "end_ms": 17890,
      "text": "直接给扣了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18690,
      "end_ms": 20230,
      "text": "老头急得直解释，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20550,
      "end_ms": 21250,
      "text": "没人信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21610,
      "end_ms": 24050,
      "text": "一个捡破烂的能有什么来头？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24790,
      "end_ms": 26070,
      "text": "直到一个小时后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26370,
      "end_ms": 28290,
      "text": "钱三强亲自跑来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28710,
      "end_ms": 29850,
      "text": "进门第一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30190,
      "end_ms": 31890,
      "text": "全场民警全傻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32130,
      "end_ms": 33510,
      "text": "你们知道他是谁吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 34030,
      "end_ms": 36790,
      "text": "他是我们国家最珍贵的大脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36830,
      "end_ms": 40570,
      "text": "这个被当成小偷抓的老头叫彭环武，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41210,
      "end_ms": 42815,
      "text": "你可能没听过这名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43370,
      "end_ms": 44330,
      "text": "但我告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 44710,
      "end_ms": 59655,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹、第一颗氢弹理论设计背后掌舵的人就是他邓稼先、周光照、俞敏这些如雷贯耳的名字全是他一手带出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 60865,
      "text": "你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61860,
      "end_ms": 63885,
      "text": "这么一位国之栋梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64280,
      "end_ms": 66580,
      "text": "当年在天桥减肥一体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66980,
      "end_ms": 68165,
      "text": "被人当小偷抓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69150,
      "end_ms": 70635,
      "text": "但这还不是最狠的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71800,
      "end_ms": 74105,
      "text": "时间倒回一九三八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74310,
      "end_ms": 78515,
      "text": "二十三岁的彭焕武考上了国家公派留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 82200,
      "text": "拿着这笔钱去英国读博了拜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82260,
      "end_ms": 87075,
      "text": "在量子力学奠基人波恩门下伯恩是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88040,
      "end_ms": 92310,
      "text": "爱因斯坦三十年的老友诺贝尔物理学奖得主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 92490,
      "end_ms": 94035,
      "text": "他给爱因斯坦写信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94420,
      "end_ms": 96295,
      "text": "专门夸这个中国学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 96710,
      "end_ms": 99685,
      "text": "彭桓武比我其他所有学生都聪明能干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 100050,
      "end_ms": 101135,
      "text": "好像什么都懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101660,
      "end_ms": 105580,
      "text": "薛定谔就是搞薛定谔的猫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 105680,
      "end_ms": 108315,
      "text": "那位大神也惊叹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 108600,
      "end_ms": 111550,
      "text": "不敢相信这年轻人学了那么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111650,
      "end_ms": 112695,
      "text": "理解的那么快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113200,
      "end_ms": 114820,
      "text": "二十五岁哲学博士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 115180,
      "end_ms": 122830,
      "text": "三十岁科学博士三十三岁当选爱尔兰皇家科学院院士、欧洲顶尖机构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123030,
      "end_ms": 129235,
      "text": "抢着给终身教职天价薪资顶级实验室永久居住权。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129680,
      "end_ms": 132965,
      "text": "全世界都觉得这中国人铁定留西方了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 133920,
      "end_ms": 135545,
      "text": "可一九四七年冬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 135930,
      "end_ms": 137030,
      "text": "彭环武干的件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137070,
      "end_ms": 138570,
      "text": "所有人都看不懂的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 139090,
      "end_ms": 140070,
      "text": "变卖欧洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 140090,
      "end_ms": 141970,
      "text": "全部家产一分不留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 142210,
      "end_ms": 144255,
      "text": "只买了一张回国的船票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 145190,
      "end_ms": 146030,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 146230,
      "end_ms": 147470,
      "text": "国外什么都有了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 147470,
      "end_ms": 148245,
      "text": "干嘛回去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148520,
      "end_ms": 150135,
      "text": "彭欢武当场不高兴了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 150790,
      "end_ms": 152005,
      "text": "这问题不该这么问。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152840,
      "end_ms": 155905,
      "text": "该问的是为什么不回国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156860,
      "end_ms": 159270,
      "text": "后来这句话传了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 159270,
      "end_ms": 161650,
      "text": "半个世纪回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 161650,
      "end_ms": 165205,
      "text": "不需要理由不回国才需要理由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 165550,
      "end_ms": 166485,
      "text": "硬不硬气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 167100,
      "end_ms": 168205,
      "text": "可回国之后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 168470,
      "end_ms": 169305,
      "text": "一穷二白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 169660,
      "end_ms": 172105,
      "text": "要啥没啥研究所刚成立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 172350,
      "end_ms": 174135,
      "text": "连实验仪器都买不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174670,
      "end_ms": 177610,
      "text": "前三强发动大家去旧货市场捡零件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 177610,
      "end_ms": 178255,
      "text": "自己做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 178810,
      "end_ms": 182070,
      "text": "彭黄武已经是爱尔兰皇家科学院院士了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 182090,
      "end_ms": 184655,
      "text": "照样跟年轻人一起跑天桥翻垃圾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184960,
      "end_ms": 187075,
      "text": "翻着翻着就被民警抓了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 187580,
      "end_ms": 189165,
      "text": "这就是开头那一幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 189530,
      "end_ms": 191035,
      "text": "你以为这就够难了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 191380,
      "end_ms": 192815,
      "text": "更狠的还在后面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 193290,
      "end_ms": 199180,
      "text": "一九五九年苏联专家全线撤离图纸设备数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 199420,
      "end_ms": 200455,
      "text": "一个字没留下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 200970,
      "end_ms": 202835,
      "text": "西方媒体公开嘲讽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 203120,
      "end_ms": 207770,
      "text": "中国二十年也造不出核武器国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207790,
      "end_ms": 208655,
      "text": "一声号令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 209120,
      "end_ms": 211840,
      "text": "彭黄武带着一群年轻人扎进戈壁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 211840,
      "end_ms": 212295,
      "text": "荒漠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 212690,
      "end_ms": 214405,
      "text": "没有高级计算机怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 214740,
      "end_ms": 216305,
      "text": "靠算盘、靠计算尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 216630,
      "end_ms": 221305,
      "text": "靠手写亿万组精密数据一笔一笔手算出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 221790,
      "end_ms": 222495,
      "text": "讨论会上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 222800,
      "end_ms": 223960,
      "text": "有人不敢开口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 224120,
      "end_ms": 224780,
      "text": "怕说错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 224780,
      "end_ms": 229825,
      "text": " Ip彭欢武拍桌子在原子弹面前没有老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 230610,
      "end_ms": 233060,
      "text": "谁也不懂有想法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 233060,
      "end_ms": 238205,
      "text": "就说谁说的对听谁的就这么着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 239150,
      "end_ms": 247975,
      "text": "他带着邓稼先、周光照、黄祖恰于敏一帮人在简陋平房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 248410,
      "end_ms": 251915,
      "text": "硬生生打通了核武器全部核心理论关卡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 252750,
      "end_ms": 254170,
      "text": "业内送他一个称号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 254250,
      "end_ms": 256710,
      "text": "培养物理学家的物理学家周光昭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 256710,
      "end_ms": 260810,
      "text": "后来说中国核物理、理论界差不多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 260830,
      "end_ms": 266495,
      "text": "所有后来的工作者都是彭桓武直接或间接的学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 267100,
      "end_ms": 269145,
      "text": "一九六四年十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 269500,
      "end_ms": 272475,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 273200,
      "end_ms": 275700,
      "text": "罗布泊的蘑菇云冲上云霄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 276060,
      "end_ms": 277240,
      "text": "举国欢腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 278160,
      "end_ms": 279160,
      "text": "庆功宴上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 279380,
      "end_ms": 283170,
      "text": "彭桓武提笔写下不是工农兵协力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 283390,
      "end_ms": 285435,
      "text": "焉得数理化成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 286040,
      "end_ms": 288135,
      "text": "功劳全给了集体。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 288610,
      "end_ms": 291590,
      "text": "后来国家自然科学奖一等奖的奖章送来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 291610,
      "end_ms": 294170,
      "text": "他坚决不收奖章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 294170,
      "end_ms": 294985,
      "text": "是我的了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 295230,
      "end_ms": 298470,
      "text": "我把它送给九所扯过一张纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 298870,
      "end_ms": 300075,
      "text": "写下十四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 301480,
      "end_ms": 307220,
      "text": "集体嗯集体集体日新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 308570,
      "end_ms": 310235,
      "text": "日新日日新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 312190,
      "end_ms": 312990,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 313410,
      "end_ms": 315450,
      "text": "一辈子隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 315870,
      "end_ms": 316950,
      "text": "默默奉献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 317330,
      "end_ms": 317850,
      "text": "委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317850,
      "end_ms": 319650,
      "text": "不他淡淡一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 320130,
      "end_ms": 321130,
      "text": "我是中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321370,
      "end_ms": 323590,
      "text": "为国做事理所应当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 325170,
      "end_ms": 325570,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 326690,
      "end_ms": 329990,
      "text": "这就是彭黄武科研上的盖世天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330670,
      "end_ms": 332870,
      "text": "生活里却笨得让人心疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 333470,
      "end_ms": 334370,
      "text": "不会做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 334610,
      "end_ms": 336530,
      "text": "不会洗衣一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336530,
      "end_ms": 338010,
      "text": "没搞懂军事旅团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338010,
      "end_ms": 340470,
      "text": "谁官大同事戴不戴眼镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340610,
      "end_ms": 341665,
      "text": "他都记不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 342100,
      "end_ms": 343180,
      "text": "四十三岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 343240,
      "end_ms": 344500,
      "text": "还是光棍一条。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 344980,
      "end_ms": 345880,
      "text": "直到有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 346080,
      "end_ms": 347600,
      "text": "二姐叫她回家吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 348000,
      "end_ms": 350720,
      "text": "一进门看见一位陌生姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 350860,
      "end_ms": 352100,
      "text": "心里咯噔一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 352480,
      "end_ms": 353420,
      "text": "又是相亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 354060,
      "end_ms": 356160,
      "text": "可这一次他没抗拒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 356580,
      "end_ms": 359980,
      "text": "因为看清眼前这位贤静端正的姑娘时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 360420,
      "end_ms": 365080,
      "text": "她从心底里喜欢上了这位姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 365080,
      "end_ms": 366040,
      "text": "叫刘炳贤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 366540,
      "end_ms": 368205,
      "text": "山东人护士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 368890,
      "end_ms": 370025,
      "text": "谁也没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 370350,
      "end_ms": 372690,
      "text": "这个生活不能自理的科学怪人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 372790,
      "end_ms": 374230,
      "text": "写出去的表白信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 374570,
      "end_ms": 376815,
      "text": "居然全在列自己的缺点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 377530,
      "end_ms": 378955,
      "text": "而姑娘的回信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 379360,
      "end_ms": 384315,
      "text": "让这个四十三岁的男人第一次感受到了家的温暖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 385430,
      "end_ms": 387985,
      "text": "他们的故事才刚开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 389750,
      "end_ms": 391205,
      "text": "而这段感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 391740,
      "end_ms": 394315,
      "text": "后来让全中国都红了眼眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 394790,
      "end_ms": 395445,
      "text": "朋友们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 395930,
      "end_ms": 397230,
      "text": "彭桓武的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 397630,
      "end_ms": 398170,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 398190,
      "end_ms": 399195,
      "text": "咱们讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 399790,
      "end_ms": 400485,
      "text": "下集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 400870,
      "end_ms": 401630,
      "text": "我给你讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 401850,
      "end_ms": 405795,
      "text": "他和妻子刘炳贤那段跨越生死的感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 406420,
      "end_ms": 410765,
      "text": "还有他晚年把自己一切都捐出去的很近。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 411460,
      "end_ms": 413940,
      "text": "如果你也被这位老人打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 413940,
      "end_ms": 414840,
      "text": "先点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 415040,
      "end_ms": 416035,
      "text": "再点收藏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 416880,
      "end_ms": 418380,
      "text": "评论区留一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 418380,
      "end_ms": 418760,
      "text": "致敬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 418760,
      "end_ms": 421695,
      "text": "彭老顺手转发给身边的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 422150,
      "end_ms": 425155,
      "text": "让更多人知道我们今天的和平日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 425470,
      "end_ms": 426630,
      "text": "是这样一群人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 426650,
      "end_ms": 428785,
      "text": "拿命换来的关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_24c0064bbdf2ff5f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 429060,
      "end_ms": 429790,
      "text": "下集接着讲。"
    }
  ],
